    {
      "id": "u_31a62cf7620ead645fa6db90_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "The Format Painter is a feature in text notes that allows users to copy the formatting of text (such as __TRILIUM_PH_0__bold__TRILIUM_PH_1__, __TRILIUM_PH_2__italic__TRILIUM_PH_3__, __TRILIUM_PH_4__Strikethrough__TRILIUM_PH_5__, etc.) and apply it to other parts of the document. It helps maintain consistent formatting and accelerates the creation of rich content.",
      "sourceHash": "31a62cf7620ead645fa6db90923295ce0a4ae1031bb6ade44bbf774e10147ddc",
      "context": "Format Painter",
      "contextHash": "3eb4f02294bee7776eab4d523df4db3c35562f0f79a9b2c46ce07e9ade561079",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_1d8f06cba4b911fc383c228e_0",
      "kind": "h2",
      "source": "Usage Instructions__TRILIUM_PH_0__",
      "sourceHash": "1d8f06cba4b911fc383c228e528f82c8f7e4b95362b3cee7633c804f2c56e040",
      "context": "Format Painter > Usage Instructions",
      "contextHash": "bfee17e504328bf5e8cb78bcc232bb99f6010078970c4dfcb811d20ffbcb71fb",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_585a78a6fdc3cb6191020914_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "Click the text that you want to copy the formatting from and use the __TRILIUM_PH_0__Copy formatting__TRILIUM_PH_1__ toolbar button (__TRILIUM_PH_2__) to copy the style. Then select the target text with your mouse, or click a word, to apply the formatting.",
      "sourceHash": "585a78a6fdc3cb619102091421f76f300c40a47503ae2b713de349e5a3fb6b39",
      "context": "Format Painter > Usage Instructions",
      "contextHash": "bfee17e504328bf5e8cb78bcc232bb99f6010078970c4dfcb811d20ffbcb71fb",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_73f12d28bf333da2bff59f61_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "__TRILIUM_PH_0__To copy the formatting__TRILIUM_PH_1__: Place the cursor inside text with some formatting and click the __TRILIUM_PH_2__Copy formatting__TRILIUM_PH_3__ toolbar button. The mouse cursor changes to indicate the painter is armed.",
      "sourceHash": "73f12d28bf333da2bff59f613e41fed0de9ed090408436ae76602244f25e64ea",
      "context": "Format Painter > Usage Instructions",
      "contextHash": "bfee17e504328bf5e8cb78bcc232bb99f6010078970c4dfcb811d20ffbcb71fb",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_45316e7ec83bd7dcbc0a0df0_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "__TRILIUM_PH_0__To paint with the copied formatting__TRILIUM_PH_1__: Select the target text with your mouse. The formatting is applied when you release the button, and the painter disarms — the cursor returns to normal. Clicking or tapping a word applies it to the whole word.",
      "sourceHash": "45316e7ec83bd7dcbc0a0df067933584080dec5ae5eb9958d3df569237188a4d",
      "context": "Format Painter > Usage Instructions",
      "contextHash": "bfee17e504328bf5e8cb78bcc232bb99f6010078970c4dfcb811d20ffbcb71fb",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_c56a6ea7c6666f1b0a4ea313_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "__TRILIUM_PH_0__To paint a selection made otherwise__TRILIUM_PH_1__, such as with the keyboard or the selection handles of a touch screen: select the target text, then use the toolbar button again, which reads __TRILIUM_PH_2__Apply formatting__TRILIUM_PH_3__ once the selection has moved. On a phone, the formatting row stays open while the painter is armed, so the button stays in reach.",
      "sourceHash": "c56a6ea7c6666f1b0a4ea313b3ebfe715277b269559b5eaa5bb8cd3681e56eb3",
      "context": "Format Painter > Usage Instructions",
      "contextHash": "bfee17e504328bf5e8cb78bcc232bb99f6010078970c4dfcb811d20ffbcb71fb",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_c9c5ab4b0b8791aaf7410ca1_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "__TRILIUM_PH_0__To cancel without painting__TRILIUM_PH_1__: Click the toolbar button again before selecting other text, or press __TRILIUM_PH_2__Escape__TRILIUM_PH_3__.",
      "sourceHash": "c9c5ab4b0b8791aaf7410ca1d20a429a4de75b80575732b1d5b89c077aaa67c9",
      "context": "Format Painter > Usage Instructions",
      "contextHash": "bfee17e504328bf5e8cb78bcc232bb99f6010078970c4dfcb811d20ffbcb71fb",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_2d166eed4e46d147ae179d3f_0",
      "kind": "h2",
      "source": "Limitations__TRILIUM_PH_0__",
      "sourceHash": "2d166eed4e46d147ae179d3feba2dbd0d28887b22a99884dc255c7ff2e43988d",
      "context": "Format Painter > Limitations",
      "contextHash": "219f6127647ecb6c77ec71a94449fdb7739d0479ae5a82b291060510ce55850c",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_8a88bb3de670d2ba0e58cec9_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "Painting with block-level formatting (like headings or image styles) is not supported yet. This is because, in __TRILIUM_PH_0__CKEditor__TRILIUM_PH_1__, they are considered a part of the content rather than text formatting.",
      "sourceHash": "8a88bb3de670d2ba0e58cec9bb9e042980b2542e0d4c70c2e49ca0a8fd12b640",
      "context": "Format Painter > Limitations",
      "contextHash": "219f6127647ecb6c77ec71a94449fdb7739d0479ae5a82b291060510ce55850c",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_98bdbce9ac78fe94a5f3d5ee_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "A click outside a word, such as between two spaces or at the end of a line, only primes the caret, so text you type there takes the copied formatting.",
      "sourceHash": "98bdbce9ac78fe94a5f3d5ee569d0d805e544fe7aeddaa140f9a5f66b21dde93",
      "context": "Format Painter > Limitations",
      "contextHash": "219f6127647ecb6c77ec71a94449fdb7739d0479ae5a82b291060510ce55850c",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_9371bdad76198dbb2cd1a699_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "The painter is one-shot; each paint requires copying the formatting again.",
      "sourceHash": "9371bdad76198dbb2cd1a69959827f508c8994a41d4a3d73751ac4d175d1cd82",
      "context": "Format Painter > Limitations",
      "contextHash": "219f6127647ecb6c77ec71a94449fdb7739d0479ae5a82b291060510ce55850c",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
